  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Industrial Energy Efficiency Through Energy Management Standard, System Optimizaton and Technology Incubation in India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will serve a dual objective of (i) promoting energy efficiency by introducing the ISO energy management standard 50001 and integrating system optimization practices in industry; and (ii) facilitating formation of technology incubators to catalyze innovation and technology transfer for cross-cutting technologies.</narrative>
  </description>
